    "detailed_description": "Upward, an exhilarating platform game, revolves around the protagonist finding themselves on a mysterious island after a plane crash. Our charming hero, determined to escape the island, focuses on reaching the highest points of the platforms encountered throughout the journey. However, this mission proves to be much more complex and filled with adventure than anticipated.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn each level, obstacles abound, not only comprising physical challenges but also featuring various traps that demand strategic thinking and quick reflexes. The platforms, designed with meticulous care, ascend in difficulty as you climb upward, offering a spectrum of colors tailored to each level. This ensures that every stage of the game presents players with new excitement and challenges.",
